        "text": "Great question! D\u00e9j\u00e0 vu is one of the brain's most fascinating \u2014 and mysterious \u2014 phenomena. Here's a breakdown of what science currently understands about it:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde0 What Is D\u00e9j\u00e0 Vu?\n\n",
