        "text": "\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Leading Theories\n\nSince ",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
            "cited_text": "There are over 40 theories attempting to decode d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu. ",
            "encrypted_index": "Eo8BCioIEBgCIiRkMmJjZWZjOS0wNDQwLTQxYWUtOTM0Mi1hNDFhNjdkYWIzZWQSDKNHVpMHoRHAUh9h0hoMb5ZQF2Hrv/K0d7vJIjDIQ2vZBrlus6FXDtDGrwP2aUgLj+oJS0wg0w1mpE7rcvelbs0Y9zs99iQAXydcNjEqE9wnBFwhdHD6RdUfGx2l4GYflwwYBA==",
