          }
        ],
        "text": "The similarity between a d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu\u2013eliciting stimulus and an existing memory trace may lead to the sensation that an experience currently being had has already been experienced in the past. Encountering something that evokes the implicit associations of an experience that cannot consciously be remembered may lead to d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 A Sign of a Healthy Brain?\n\nInterestingly, experiencing occasional d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu may actually be a good sign. ",
